# contractions.tbl — token before 't | the auxiliary it stands for   (won is handled by the lexical layer: won 't -> will 't)

don | do
doesn | does
didn | did
isn | is
aren | are
wasn | was
weren | were
haven | have
hasn | has
hadn | had
wouldn | would
couldn | could
shouldn | should
mustn | must
oughtn | ought
can | can
needn | need
cannot | can
